  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, when you are the target of a spell or included in the area of a spell, you can deflect the spell as a reaction. The spell must be on your list of known spells and you spend a number of sorcery points equal to twice that spell's level.</p>\n<p>Upon deflection, you automatically succeed on your saving throw against the spell and you can direct the spell's effect to a creature within 10 feet of you, if desired. If the spell does not have a saving throw, it has no effect on you. If a creature was also targeted by the spell or included in the area of the spell, you cannot redirect the spell to that creature.</p>",
